			"date": "2024-11-30T15:38:54.848Z",
			"content": "<p>I’m finding some rough edges, like GitHub prompting me in Chrome to scan the QR code for my passkey saved on another device — except it’s not on another device — I just created it with Safari. But overall, yeah I agree. I wish I could replace all of my passwords with passkeys today.</p>",
