			},
			"date": "2024-12-04T13:35:07.263Z",
			"content": "<p>Passkeys: so intuitive it’s scary. But isn’t that the dream for every UX designer? Seamless, second nature, and just a little magic. 🪄🔐 <a href=\"https://bsky.app/hashtag/UXWin\">#UXWin</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
